    "description": "## Summary\n\nFixes a racy assertion in `PromptQueuePanel.test.tsx` that fails `Lint, Typecheck & Test` on `dev` and blocks the v0.4.50 release PR (#1381).\n\n## Related Issue\n\nNo related issue. CI repair on `dev`.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n## What Changed\n\n- `mobile shell > expands on tap and names each action after its queued text` asserted `toBeVisible()` right after the click. The panel expands through `CollapseExpandMotion`, which starts the content at inline `opacity: 0` and animates to 1 over 150ms. The assertion only passed when that animation happened to finish first. It now waits for the expanded state with `waitFor`.\n\n## How It Was Tested\n\n## Checklist\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nFixes a flaky assertion in `PromptQueuePanel.test.tsx` that failed CI and blocked the v0.4.50 release. The test now waits for the panel's expansion animation to finish before checking visibility, instead of asserting immediately after click.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 5ba1fabe14af8a47da4ca1d2836b332fadb3afaf. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/gnoviawan/termul/pull/1384?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"View guided diff\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://www.cubic.dev/action/auto-fix/pr/gnoviawan/termul/1384?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fgnoviawan%2Ftermul%2Fpull%2F1384&source=description\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Turn on auto-fix\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-light.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->",
